to-be-incorporated-into-paper-92 : List Word
to-be-incorporated-into-paper-92 = unlines (cons "In the Hyperactive Workflow, the organization of the work on hyperactivity by a graph of tasks: **States.** A node is in progress or pending. There is one owner, Avik, and sessions hold no" (cons "identity. The workflow lists the leaves in progress (`in-progress`) and the nodes resolved, each with" (cons "its witness (`resolved`); every other needed leaf is pending. A resolved node stays in the graph. A" (cons "node with children is also resolved when all of them are; a leaf under a resolved node that serves" (cons "nothing unresolved is no longer open work." nil)))))
